# Maw3ed Local-first

- Develop only against the local workspace at `E:\UpNexa.com\maw3ed` (or the opened local clone). Do not treat Cursor Cloud Agents as the primary development environment.
- Preferred flow: local changes → `npm run update:*` / `npm run refresh` → commit and push to GitHub → deploy to VPS from Git.
- Keep Maw3ed on ports `7000` (API/web) and `7100` (Vite). Never bind to `5000` (UpNexa).
- Default runtime is local in-memory data unless `MAW3ED_STORAGE=postgres` and `DATABASE_URL` are set explicitly.
- After successful local verification, use `npm run release:prepare` before pushing and deploying.
